	(text "Jacks on the Alchemist positions: IN (J402, right lower), EXP (J406, right upper), OUT L (J403, left lower), OUT R (J404, left upper).\nRelay true bypass after The Relic: K401 at rest joins IN to OUT L (3-4) and grounds the effect input (9-10); energised it routes IN to the effect (8-9) and the effect to OUT L (4-5).\nOUT R is driven straight from the DSP and is silent in true bypass; stereo players use Trails mode. The effect and Hold LEDs and the relay coil run from +9V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left bottom)
			)
		(uuid "c6dc7b14-5581-4b66-93de-bf7eee4856d1")
	)
